- starter deps pull all basiic require jar files
- many starter deps are available like for data-jpa, web, batch etc.
- @EnableAutoConfiguration -> spring boot automatically creates bean of spring config class 
- @SpringBootConfiguration simply extends @Configuration
- @SpringBootApplication(scanBasePackages="class path") combine of @ComponentScan("class path"),@EnableAutoConfiguration,@SpringBootConfiguration
- eg : Example of AutoConfig
      what you include     At runtime, Spring boot check if     what Spring boot does
    Embedded DB dep         HSQLDB on classpath                  datasource config
    Starter jdbc            if datasource configured             JdbcTemplate Configured
                            if datasource not configured         runtime error

## Packaging 
  - for build jar gradle assemble or mvn package
  - it creates .jar (fat jar, all code and dep) and .jar.original (all code)
  - add maven plugin

## Integration testing
  - @SptingBootTest(classes = Application.class) it will take same configuration as original application for test env
  - @SptingBootTest alternative @SpringJunitConfiguration
  - @SpringBootTest is search for @SpringBootConfiguration and create application context for the test

